 Academy is no ordinary cooking school. This elite institution is filled with culinary giants like Erina “God Tongue” Nakiri, who does her best to keep a lowly short-order like Souma from even making it inside the door. However, if the snobs can dish it out, Souma can serve it up, and when he learns that only a handful of the students manage to graduate every year, he swears that the only way he’ll leave is as number one!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Food","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Educational","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":35,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tentacles","rank":34,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":32,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Food Wars!","english":"Food Wars!","native":"食戟のソーマ","romaji":"Shokugeki no Souma","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"食戟之灵"}]},"trailer":{"id":"Ei7r95k5d_Q","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ei7r95k5d_Q/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}